     6486   define variable vss-include-info49 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     6487   on help of frame dialog-frame
     6488   do:
     6489     run gbl/app_help.p
     6490       (input this-procedure :file-name
     6491       ,input ''
     6492       ,input ?
     6493       ) no-error.
     6494     if error-status :error then do:
     6495       message
